# Frontend (Next.js)

Applies to `admin-panel/` and `client/`.

## Stack

- Next.js 16.3, React 19, App Router
- Tailwind CSS v4 (not v3 patterns)
- Zustand with per-request store pattern; React state for local UI
- Persian RTL-first; prefer logical CSS properties
- Tailwind v4 logical insets: `inset-s-*` / `inset-e-*` (not `start-*` /
  `end-*`); see `docs/frontend/styling.md`

## Rules

- Prefer Server Components; Client Components only when required.
- Use `proxy.ts` for Next.js 16 request interception; do not add `middleware.ts` for new work.
- Feature components under `src/components/<domain>/`; primitives under `src/components/ui/`.
- Respect Nest integration ADRs: `client/` may wire Nest auth/JWT fetch (ADR
  0011); `admin-panel/` may wire staff Nest auth/admin JWT fetch (ADR 0012).
  Shared hybrid transport: ADR 0010 (separate cookie jars; different UX).
- For version-sensitive Next.js behavior (fetch, cache, Server Actions, Cache Components, etc.), read that app’s `node_modules/next/dist/docs/` — installed docs beat model memory. Details: `docs/frontend/nextjs.md`.
- Admin UI (Base UI shadcn): before Select, DropdownMenu, Dialog, AlertDialog,
  or Sheet, read
  [`admin-panel/docs/development/components.md`](../../admin-panel/docs/development/components.md).
  Do not copy Radix Select habits.
  - Select: put visible label children in `SelectValue`; set
    `SelectContent alignItemWithTrigger={false}`.
  - DropdownMenu: wrap every `DropdownMenuLabel` in `DropdownMenuGroup`.
  - Overlays: Dialog = short create/pick; AlertDialog = irreversible confirm;
    Sheet = inspector/filters/mobile nav only (not the default overlay).
- Nest API failures: map `error.code` first (`lib/api/map-api-error.ts`); show localized copy (client: `ApiErrors` i18n; admin: FA `STAFF_API_ERROR_MESSAGES`); toast failed POST mutations — see [`docs/backend/contracts/api-errors.md`](../../docs/backend/contracts/api-errors.md).
- Positive-only JSX: `{condition && <Component />}` — never
  `{condition ? <Component /> : null}`. Coerce strings/numbers
  (`!!label`, `count > 0`). Ternary only when both branches render UI.
  Shared canonical:
  [`docs/frontend/nextjs.md`](../../docs/frontend/nextjs.md#positive-only-jsx-branches).
  Per-app detail: `admin-panel/.agents/skills/react-19` and
  `client/.agents/skills/react-19`.
- Client dashboard pages: add co-located `loading.tsx` with a skeleton that
  mirrors the live layout; when structure changes, update the skeleton in the
  same change —
  [`client/docs/engineering/ui.md`](../../client/docs/engineering/ui.md#customer-dashboard-loading-skeletons).

